    "description": "Tale about railway station district in Frankfurt with Rio Reiser (Ton Steine Scherbern) in cast, directed and played by actor of Fassbinder (\"Pioniere in Ingolstadt\", \"Warnung vor einer heiligen Nutte'), Michael Fengler (\"Weg vom Fenster\", \"Eierdiebe\"), Hans Noever and Hark Bohm. Schlicht is also autor of well-known article \"Armer Deutscher Film\" as Olga Grüber (which is referenced in Thomas Elsaesser's and Mattias Frey's works about New German Cinema) and novel about Münchner Gruppe \"Im Augenblick der Freiheit\".",
